WEBVTT

50:30.477 --> 50:33.437
Don't you get it?
You see the hat?

50:33.522 --> 50:38.484
-I am Mrs Nesbitt!
-Snap out of it, Buzz!

50:42.364 --> 50:44.573
I'm sorry. I...
You're right.

50:44.658 --> 50:47.535
I am just a little depressed.
That's all.

50:47.619 --> 50:49.662
I can get through this.

50:49.746 --> 50:51.539
Oh, I'm a sham!

50:51.623 --> 50:52.915
-Look at me.
-Quiet, Buzz.

50:52.999 --> 50:55.876
I can't even fly out of a window.

50:55.961 --> 50:59.213
The hat looked good?
Tell me the hat looked good.

50:59.297 --> 51:02.091
-The apron is a bit much.
-"Out the window"!
